#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:225
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Shortcuts to the most important _Maxima_ commands or things like a table of contents, windows with debug messages or a history of the last issued commands can be accessed using the side panes. They can be enabled using the \"View\" menu. They all can be moved to other locations inside or outside the _wxMaxima_ window. Other useful panes is the one that allows to input Greek letters using the mouse."
