#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:696
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Generates the skeleton of a `draw()` command that draws a 2D scene. This scene later has to be filled with commands that generate the scene's contents, for example by using the buttons in the rows below the \"2D\" button."
