#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:698
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "One helpful feature of the 2D button is that it allows to setup the scene as an animation in which a variable (by default it is _t_) has a different value in each frame: Often an moving 2D plot allows easier interpretation than the same data in a non-moving 3D one."
